    - target: {fileID: 5546846749650900948, guid: 64e96864babe44084a28c2a4eb622e4a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Leopard spots are small, dark-ringed patterns in Martian rocks formed
        by chemical reactions involving water.\nNASA\u2019s Perseverance discovered
        these features while studying rocks in Jezero Crater in July 2024, and they're
        the clearest signs yet of ancient microbial life on Mars!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
