    - target: {fileID: 6542990833006065759, guid: 64e96864babe44084a28c2a4eb622e4a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Mission: Pinpoint a biosignature

        1. Use the control panel
        to control Ingenuity''s aerial view.

        2. Select a rock on the screen
        to scan. Greener areas indicate more promising results.

        3. After
        scanning all rocks, click within Ingenuity''s suggested drilling radius on
        the screen!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
